{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>The enemy said.</b> This is Pharaoh." "And the word תמלאמו is difficult. Rabbi Marinus said: My soul will be filled from them, taking all their wealth, like the manner of 'their children have gone forth' (Jeremiah 10:20), and the meaning connects with 'I will divide the spoil.' And others say: from the derivation of 'that has filled his heart' (Esther 7:5)." "And afterward I will dispossess them." "My hand will dispossess them. It will destroy them, and likewise 'and if you do not dispossess' (Numbers 33:55)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:34:42.201613730Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}